WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:03.450
Never put passwords, card numbers,

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:07.050
bank numbers, or Social Security numbers into Grok,

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.400
or any chat.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.330
If you need help with something private,

00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:14.187
swap the names and numbers for something like Customer A.

